Pages = {287-293},
Month = {MAR},
Abstract = {PurposeOur facility aimed to establish a standardized process to guide
   healthcare team members to incorporate doulas in the labor and delivery
   setting while meeting regulatory and safety requirements and promoting
   operational transparency.DescriptionDoulas provide emotional, physical,
   and educational support to patients and families throughout the
   pregnancy, birth, and postpartum journey. Doula care has been identified
   with improved maternal and neonatal birth outcomes, as well as improved
   perceptions of the birthing process.AssessmentOur facility lacked a
   standard operating procedure for successfully incorporating doulas into
   the healthcare team.ConclusionWe developed strategies to promote doula
   inclusivity in our labor and delivery environment with safety and
   quality at the core of our focus.},
